+// Whether that window closes once the link's little window is open. A launch
+// whose only work was a link that became a little window shouldn't also leave
+// the empty window Chromium opens at every launch. Restored windows, windows
+// with anything in them, and launches that opened tabs stay as they are.
+bool ShouldCloseStartupWindow(bool link_came_with_launch,
+                              LinkRoute route,
+                              const StartupWindowFacts& window);
